d over the complete weighing range for all products and weighing in motion (dynamic weighing). For single products having especially their own Price Look Up and/or their own product-specific parameters greater tare loads are allowed if they are approved by the LMC.\"},\n    {\"marker\": \"4)\", \"text\": \"For weighing instruments of the categories XIIIH(x ≥ 2) and Y(b) the number of verification scale intervals is limited to ni ≤ 1000.\"},\n    {\"marker\": \"5)\", \"text\": \"The same minimum capacities as for category Y according to MID, Annex I, chap. II No 5, may be applied to category X. Greater minimum loads may also result from the LMC in general.\"}\n  ]\n}"
